}


### Employees Draft Prepare
# @name Employees_Draft_Prepare
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/admin/Employees(ID={{draftID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/AdminService.draftPrepare
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{username}}:{{password}}

{}


